rnal, with no material impact on interest income/expense. **Core business growth (excluding acquisitions) was 6% YoY**, with expectations of improvement in H2 FY27. Management reiterated confidence in **sustained profitable growth** through FY27, citing **portfolio diversification, digital adoption, and cost discipline** as key enablers.",
